<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.2 </span>Prompt for analysis of reasoning traces</h3>

<div id="A3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use the following prompt to extract features from 25 randomly sampled reasoning traces for each of the eight tasks. The prompt is used in conjunction with a Pydantic “response_format” and <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T=0</annotation></semantics></math>. The model we use is <span id="A3.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">gpt-4.1-2025-04-14</span> model from OpenAI.</p>
<div id="A3.SS2.p1.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx136" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx137" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx137.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">SYSTEM</span><span id="lstnumberx137.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">PROMPT</span><span id="lstnumberx137.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">:</span><span id="lstnumberx137.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">You</span><span id="lstnumberx137.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">are</span><span id="lstnumberx137.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">a</span><span id="lstnumberx137.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">reasoning</span><span id="lstnumberx137.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">expert</span><span id="lstnumberx137.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">and</span><span id="lstnumberx137.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">will</span><span id="lstnumberx137.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">be</span><span id="lstnumberx137.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">tasked</span><span id="lstnumberx137.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">with</span><span id="lstnumberx137.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">analyzing</span><span id="lstnumberx137.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">reasoning</span><span id="lstnumberx137.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">traces</span><span id="lstnumberx137.31" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">of</span><span id="lstnumberx137.33" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.34" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">large</span><span id="lstnumberx137.35" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.36" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">language</span><span id="lstnumberx137.37" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.38" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">models</span><span id="lstnumberx137.39" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.40" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">writing</span><span id="lstnumberx137.41" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.42" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">their</span><span id="lstnumberx137.43" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.44" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">own</span><span id="lstnumberx137.45" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.46" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">reasoning</span><span id="lstnumberx137.47" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx137.48" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">programs</span>
</div>
